{title: Aankhon Me Base Ho Tum}
{artist: Abhijeet Anu Malik Alka Yagnik}
{key: Bm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Bm] Aankhon Mein Basey Ho Tum,        [Bm] Tumhen Dil Mein Chhupa Lunga
[A] Jab Chahun Tumhen Dekhun,        [G] Aaina Banaa Lun [A] ga
[Bm] heeeeeeeeee,        [Em] hoooooo [A] ooo
[Bm] Takdeer Meri Ab To,        Tak [A] deer Tumhaari Hai
Jahan [E] Dil Tha Kabhi Mera,        Tasv [Bm] eer Tumhaari Hai
[Bm] Ye Lab Jo Tere Larase,        Mere [A] Dil Mein Hui Halchal
Mera [E] Chain Churata Hai,        Teri [Bm] Aankh Ka Kaajal
[Bm] Abhi Chain Churaaya Hai,        [Bm] Kal Tumhen Churaa Lungi
[A] Jab Chahun Tumhen Dekhun,        [G] Aaina Banaa Lun [A] gi
[Bm] Tu Paas Jo Mere Hai,        Kya [A] Kaam Bahaaron Se
Ye Cham [E] keele Naina,        Kya [Bm] Kaam Sitaaron Se
[Bm] Tere Naam Ki Dhadkan Hon,        Tere [A] Naam Ki Saansen Hon
Ik Pal [E] Na Judaa Ho Tum,        Aankhon [Bm] Mein Aankhen Hon
[Bm] Koi Naame-E-Vafaa Poochhe,        Maein [Bm] Naam Tera Lunga
Jab [A] Chahun Tumhen Dekhun,        [G] Aaina Banaa Lun [A] ga
